NEWSWORTHY NUMBER

How much Simple Machines Made Simple, a picture book on mechanical engineer=
ing for kids, exceeded its Kickstarter goal by, thanks to 6.8k+ backers who=
=E2=80=99ve pledged $357k+. The guide, which pairs interactive models like =
spinning wheels and levers with real-world examples, was created by compute=
r engineer Chase Roberts, who also authored the viral book Computer Enginee=
ring for Babies in 2021.

If you=E2=80=99re wondering what kind of child would reach for such books, =
the answer is probably none. Roberts told (https://www.fastcompany.com/9143=
9043/simple-machines-book-explain-physics-to-a-2-year-old?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-=
_whMP5hqTLehJmtV6jDpRtFP1ImfbW_N-v3JfAzVB2QQcoNes_fCgw3sZR3ylxgBgDH8F8Z2sOp=
e0ok8HlsWUr-KWpzw&_hsmi=3D395307565 ) Fast Company his target audience aren=
=E2=80=99t tykes themselves, but engineers who want to teach their kids abo=
ut the work they do in a fun way.

Oh, to imagine all the sterile things that=E2=80=99ll eventually induce chi=
ldhood nostalgia in those youngins.

