br><br>There=E2=80=99s something very satisfying about writing with a fount=
ain pen, but they can be expensive. A Montblanc pen could set you back&nbsp=
;$1k+. <br><br>But there are several companies, largely in China, that prod=
uce knockoff versions of pricier models, <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.c=
