<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold; font-size: =
18px;">What=E2=80=99s so great about fountain pens?</span> <br><br>They use=
 a metal nib and refillable liquid ink, whereas the more common ballpoint p=
en uses a rolling ball and an oil-based ink. Fountain pens, thus, require l=
ess pressure to use and allow for a smoother, easier writing experience tha=
t many find more enjoyable.&nbsp;<br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">They=E2=80=99re also customizable, with many =
different sizes and kinds of nibs, not to mention refillable inks. Some ent=
husiasts boast vast =E2=80=94 and expensive =E2=80=94 collections.&nbsp;</p=
>
<h2 style=3D"margin:0; font-size:18px; line-height:150%">&nbsp;</h2>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold; font-size:18px">These enthu=
siasts=E2=80=A6</p>
<h2 style=3D"margin:0; font-size:18px; line-height:150%">&nbsp;</h2>
